# Deploy to Production

After every code change in this project:

1. Commit with a clear message describing the change.
2. Push to `origin main` so Vercel deploys to production.
3. Do this automatically without waiting for the user to ask, unless they explicitly say not to push.

Remote: `https://github.com/Techsynx/exhuzaifa.git`
